CORE smt-backend broken-cprover-smt-backend no-new-smt
nested-quantifier.c
--cvc5
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^VERIFICATION ERROR$
--
--arrays-exp implies --fmf-bound in cvc5, which disables prenexing and leaves
the outer quantifier without a trigger: cvc5 then reports unknown unless it is
also given --no-fmf-bound.
